[relay] WebSocket relay running on port 8080
[relay] For same-device testing: ws://localhost:8080/ws/:roomId?userId=Alice
[relay] For cross-device: find this device's local IP, then use:
[relay]   ws://<this-device-ip>:8080/ws/:roomId?userId=Alice
[relay] Find your IP: ipconfig getifaddr en0  (macOS) or ip addr  (Linux)
